<!-- Entity handling, twice over.

     The OP quotes its attributes with &quot; (the spelling the live RSSHub feed
     uses) and contains doubly-escaped quotes in the body text.

     The reply is the case that justifies extract_links: its href is written with
     &amp;#x2F;, so after XML parsing the HTML still holds `&#x2F;` character
     references. A regex reading that markup sees `https://github.com&#x2F;...`,
     whose host is not github.com — only html.parser's attribute decoding recovers
     the repository. -->
